  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/delphi-v2-template-counts> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/references> <https://w3id.org/np/RAbjeus1yO4SqlPLnpIWNLS6nvW0DGF3879tVduuE0y00> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/delphi-v2-template-counts> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/references> <https://w3id.org/np/RAtLFqIIyu4r-GlMcBEfmDtbV-CHwWxQ49gVMtHIX6r48> .
